/* 2012-01-24新增；2026-10-18 absolute→fixed：竖屏时文档高远大于视口，
   absolute 只盖 body(768) 那一段、提示层截断在半空，fixed 恒盖满可视区 */
.orientationchange{
background:url(../img/common/orientationchange.jpg) center center no-repeat #000;
background-size:800px 733px;
position: fixed;
width: 100%;
height: 100%;
left: 0;
